WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.232
Night observation can feel more intrusive because people may reasonably expect greater

00:00:05.232 --> 00:00:09.936
privacy after dark and may not recognize the aircraft or mission.

00:00:09.936 --> 00:00:15.068
A lawful flight can still cause unnecessary concern or collect sensitive activity.

00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:19.344
Limit collection to the authorized purpose, area, time, and detail.

00:00:19.344 --> 00:00:23.193
Aim sensors away from unrelated homes, windows, yards, people,

00:00:23.193 --> 00:00:25.331
and sensitive facilities where practical.

00:00:25.331 --> 00:00:30.035
Do not use darkness to conceal observation or avoid accountable notice.

00:00:30.035 --> 00:00:35.595
Protect stored imagery and metadata because they may reveal locations, routines, access points,

00:00:35.595 --> 00:00:37.306
identities, or operational activity.

00:00:37.306 --> 00:00:41.582
Use approved access controls, encrypted storage and transfer where appropriate,

00:00:41.582 --> 00:00:42.865
and restricted exports.

00:00:42.865 --> 00:00:47.569
Retention should match the mission, policy, legal requirements, and evidentiary need.

00:00:47.569 --> 00:00:50.563
Delete unnecessary incidental material through approved procedures.

00:00:50.563 --> 00:00:54.839
Avoid indefinite storage simply because data is inexpensive to keep.

00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:59.116
Document purpose, authority, crew, time, area, collection settings, access, distribution,

00:00:59.116 --> 00:01:00.399
and significant decisions.

00:01:00.399 --> 00:01:06.813
Reports should distinguish direct observations from interpretations and avoid exposing sensitive location details without need.

00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:09.807
Low-light imagery can also increase misidentification risk.

00:01:09.807 --> 00:01:12.800
Do not label a person, vehicle, activity,

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.222
or intent from weak silhouettes or noisy video.

00:01:16.222 --> 00:01:20.498
Report the visible evidence, limitations, and need for independent confirmation.

00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:24.775
Do not use night operations for stalking, harassment, unlawful surveillance,

00:01:24.775 --> 00:01:28.624
targeting private individuals, flight-restriction bypass, or evasion of oversight.

00:01:28.624 --> 00:01:31.189
Responsible practice combines safety, privacy, proportionality,

00:01:31.189 --> 00:01:32.900
and explainable human accountability.
